{
  "_comment": "DoE: 2-view mlp_logsig+bilinear, logsig_mode=window_smooth/tukey/window_size=128, on capture24→USC_HAD and capture24→Opportunity (channel_adapt=pca, per A4/B precedent for channel-count mismatches). Three transform arms per dataset pair, each sweeping logsig_lead_lag over [0,8,16,32] (0 doubles as the tukey128 baseline, free via pretrain dedup): (1) lead-lag alone; (2) lead-lag x redundancy_penalty in [0.001,0.01,0.1] (Barlow-Twins cross-view penalty, cf. D2); (3) logsig_normalize=true + lead-lag ('norm+lead-lag'). run_modes=finetune only (freeze/baseline don't depend on the ablated hyperparams, cf. D2). Run with: python scripts/run_experiments.py experiment_configs/experiments_2view_tukey128_leadlag.json --gpus 6,7,8",
  "experiments": [
    {
      "name": "capture24→USC_HAD (2-view mlp_logsig+bilinear, tukey128): lead-lag sweep",
      "enabled": true,
      "pretrain": {
        "data_name": "_DA_capture24_256_00",
        "num_feature": 3,
        "num_target": 1
      },
      "finetune_targets": [
        {
          "data_name": "_DA_USC_HAD_256_00",
          "num_feature": 6,
          "num_target": 12,
          "channel_adapt": "pca"
        }
      ],
      "fixed": {
        "view2": "logsig",
        "encoder_type": "mlp_logsig",
        "logsig_depth": 2,
        "logsig_mode": "window_smooth",
        "logsig_smoothing": "tukey",
        "logsig_window_size": 128,
        "interaction_type": "bilinear",
        "epochs_pretrain": 2,
        "epochs_finetune": 10,
        "batch_size_pretrain": 128,
        "run_modes": "finetune"
      },
      "grid": {
        "logsig_lead_lag": [0, 8, 16, 32],
        "seed": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]
      }
    },
